    ('cf5b134a-f68f-5142-93dd-34a035dcd4c2', (SELECT cv.content_version_id FROM card_content_versions cv INNER JOIN cards c ON c.card_id = cv.card_id WHERE c.gorilla_card_id = '666' AND cv.content_sha256 = '839ca1408b16041722f65abebea1a5ab94ee884507dd001297efdb8005547113'), 2, 154, 'benefit', '생활', '유튜브프리미엄, 넷플릭스, 멜론 정기결제 20% 청구할인 배달의민족, 요기요 10% 청구할인', '[스트리밍/배달앱]
